'''Corn Mines''' are stationary dirt like enemies that will go off either when their health is depleted, after some time passes that they begin the detonation process by flashing, or if Isaac gets close to them that they'll instantly begin to detonate. This will release a cloud of poisonous gas similar to one released from [[Mushroom (Obstacle)|Mushrooms]] and fire eight corny shots in all directions.

